    },
    "talks": [
        {
            "talkId": "6955401",
            "initDialog": "695540101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695540101",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "…骰子点数不错。那就再多来几局吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955402",
            "initDialog": "695540201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695540201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "进行「七圣召唤」的对局吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955403",
            "initDialog": "695540301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695540301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "暂时有别的事…"
                },
                {
                    "id": "695540302",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "嗯，过一会我也要回去了…也不能翘班太久啊。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955404",
            "initDialog": "695540401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695540401",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "智者千算，终有一失。要不要再来一局？说不定，下一局就轮到我失算了。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955405",
            "initDialog": "695540501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695540501",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "是我输了。看来在这牌局之上，是你更善「算计」。呵呵…我得向你请教。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955406",
            "initDialog": "695540601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695540601",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "开局吧，希望我们两人都有好骰运。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955408",
            "initDialog": "695540801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695540801",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "进行「七圣召唤」的对局吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955409",
            "initDialog": "695540901",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695540901",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "先调整一下卡组…"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955410",
            "initDialog": "695541001",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695541001",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "好，这局到此为止了，下一局再努力试试赢我吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955411",
            "initDialog": "695541101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695541101",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "看来，今天是我的骰运不济啊。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955412",
            "initDialog": "695541201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695541201",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "好啊，看看这次我们谁的运气更好。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955414",
            "initDialog": "695541401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695541401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "进行「七圣召唤」的对局吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955415",
            "initDialog": "695541501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695541501",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "先调整一下卡组…"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955416",
            "initDialog": "695541601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695541601",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "我赢了。和你对局可真不轻松，还好，这局的骰子比较听话。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955417",
            "initDialog": "695541701",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695541701",
                    "speaker": "夜兰",
                    "text": "骰子，看来并没有站在我这边啊。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955418",
            "initDialog": "695541801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695541801",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "暂时有别的事…"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}